[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2220.069, "timestamp": "00:37:00", "text": "[拍手]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2223.91, "timestamp": "00:37:03", "text": "なぜ私はHに行ったのか、そしてこれ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2226.23, "timestamp": "00:37:06", "text": "あの野郎はもう私のことを忘れたのか、ああ私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2228.309, "timestamp": "00:37:08", "text": "悪口を言っても大丈夫だといいな、大丈夫だよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2231.47, "timestamp": "00:37:11", "text": "まあ、そうかもしれないね。だって、みんなもっと悪態をつくから。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2234.95, "timestamp": "00:37:14", "text": "私よりも彼らはクレイジーなことをたくさんする"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2238.03, "timestamp": "00:37:18", "text": "私よりもあなたのようなもの"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2240.049, "timestamp": "00:37:20", "author": "@Hero_338", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/0uNlIhqsigPTN5hDlTHiX6E1xHNJL_TKrsEvxszwXL5t9cJLNqnfZ0L6Wz1pkyw3Fb-F_l4e=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "omg i would never"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2240.87, "timestamp": "00:37:20", "text": "スペードを知ってるよ、ああそうだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2244.03, "timestamp": "00:37:24", "text": "ああ、もう新しいことは何？新しいことは何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2246.51, "timestamp": "00:37:26", "text": "名前"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2248.866, "timestamp": "00:37:28", "author": "@Hero_338", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/0uNlIhqsigPTN5hDlTHiX6E1xHNJL_TKrsEvxszwXL5t9cJLNqnfZ0L6Wz1pkyw3Fb-F_l4e=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i am a holy person"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2252.87, "timestamp": "00:37:32", "text": "ええ、私たちはそれをからかう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2256.67, "timestamp": "00:37:36", "text": "猫のミームを知ってるでしょ、って言ってるんだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2259.19, "timestamp": "00:37:39", "text": "うんうん、詰め物をしている猫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2261.19, "timestamp": "00:37:41", "text": "顔に食べ物を詰め込んでいる子猫と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2275.39, "timestamp": "00:37:55", "text": "ああ、神様、私は絶対にそんなことはしません。私は聖なる者です。"}]